Design attribution
====================

The jonbeckman-github-runner app follows the architecture published by
zot24 in https://github.com/zot24/umbrel-apps (app id zot24-github-runner):
a dependency-free Node manager, one ephemeral JIT runner container per job
inside a private docker:dind daemon, private repositories only, fork jobs
refused, a parallel cap with a memory split, and a setup page behind
Umbrel's app_proxy login.

That repository has no LICENSE file (GitHub's license API returns 404).
Copyright in that code stays with its author. Nothing in this repository
is a copy of that source, tests, or page. This tree is an independent
implementation of the same kind of Umbrel app, written for Jonathan's
store, with the changes described in the app README (multiple resource
owners, a generic per-repo cache, Prometheus metrics, and the fleet
toolchain).
